  "subject": {
    "id": "contract-compiler-integrated-evidence-schema",
    "type": "DOCUMENT"
  },
  "summary": "Close the first integrated-candidate gate failures.",
  "why": "The first seal attempt proved that the composed evidence schema rejected its own required result field. Adversarial review then proved that a top-level PASS could mask failed checks and that ACTIVE work could be selected. This revision makes evidence exact, requires typed all-PASS reports, requires COMPLETE selection state, and adds hard regression tests."
